{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:be21d6286bde6275","name":"Ahsoka Tano","source":{"id":"source:reference-be21d6286bde6275","title":"Ahsoka Tano","revision":15766,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:08Z","sha256":"c05c30c6b0c1bc70ac2347ffe377840c79d7090985e414f531d61224dee124ed","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15766","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ahsoka%20Tano&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-be21d6286bde6275","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The young ",{"tag":"a","children":["Togruta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Togruta","referenceId":"reference:8eb79b436fea84b0"}," Jedi named Ahsoka Tano is assigned to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Anakin Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Anakin_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:e7c68f75d23b428e"}," as his Padawan by Master ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yoda"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yoda","referenceId":"reference:d9309d04bb8c9468"}," in an effort to teach him responsibility. Although the two were often at odds at the beginning, they eventually form a strong master/apprentice relationship.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Being as impulsive as her master, Ahsoka manages to get herself into her fair share of trouble. This trouble included going face to face with some of the most powerful villains leading the Separatists, including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Asajj Ventress"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Asajj_Ventress","referenceId":"reference:ea8cf149feb46cfd"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["General Grievous"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/General_Grievous","referenceId":"reference:ff638626530ef283"},". Many more experienced Jedi met their end facing these opponents and her surviving these encounters showed that she's as talented as she is impulsive.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During this time Ahsoka sometimes found herself working with other Jedi Masters besides Anakin. Both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aayla Secura"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aayla_Secura","referenceId":"reference:29802751baa3c6b7"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Luminara Unduli"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Luminara_Unduli?action=edit&redlink=1"}," pass on great wisdom and knowledge to the young ",{"tag":"a","children":["Togruta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Togruta","referenceId":"reference:8eb79b436fea84b0"}," and they learn from her in return. She doesn't learn from only ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," but also from the clones she worked with as well. Being around the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Troopers"}," of the Republic gave Ahsoka the military background and confidence that she would need time and time again to lead them into battle.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Ahsoka Tano Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Togruta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Togruta","referenceId":"reference:8eb79b436fea84b0"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 5/",{"tag":"a","children":[